108:| `?` | Help | Per-view help (usage, legend, example, keys); `m` there for the full map |
109:| `;` | More | Toggle the key bar's layer |
134:| `R` / `S` | Report / Standup | Write an HTML report / show the week's standup |
232:## Reports
234:`R` in the app, or from the shell:
237:taskboard --report                       # the whole board
238:taskboard --report "Website Redesign"    # one project
241:Each writes one self-contained HTML file to a `reports` folder beside your board file and
260:- `Ctrl+Shift+B` toggles the window frame and `F11` borderless fullscreen (WezTerm keys).
273:| `reports/` | HTML reports |
284:| `taskboard --report [PROJECT]` | Write a report and exit |
296:  app.py          the App: views, selection, keys, team sync timer
297:  keymap.py       every key binding (the one source of the key bar and the palette)
303:  report.py       the HTML report
309:docs/             screenshots and a sample report
